    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Modifies .ts source files, and the files in scope are the load-bearing seams of the add-in: the host abstraction (IHostAdapter, WordAdapter, OutlookAdapter, HostAdapterFactory) and the auth and API clients. Root CLAUDE.md section 8 makes .ts modification a FULL-rigor trigger; the Step 9.5 gates matter here because ADR-028 is arch-test enforced on this exact surface and because task 010 will rewrite WordAdapter on top of whatever this task leaves behind.</rigor-reason>
